1 super() is not supported: classes have no inheritance (SPEC §5.11.6)
2 property() is not supported: there are no descriptors or decorators
3 classmethod() is not supported: there are no decorators
4 staticmethod() is not supported: there are no decorators
5 issubclass() is not supported: classes have no inheritance
6 breakpoint() is not supported: there is no interactive debugger
7 help() is not supported: there is no interactive help (SPEC.md is the reference)
8 memoryview() is not supported: bytes are immutable and have no buffer views
9 object() is not supported: define your own class — every class is already a root
10 done
